Two example notebooks imported ``Measure`` from ``qcodes.measure`` and
``MatPlot`` from ``qcodes.plots.qcmatplotlib``. Those modules moved to the
``qcodes_loop`` package and the deprecated aliases in QCoDeS have since been
removed, so the notebooks failed at their import cell. They now import from
``qcodes_loop``, which is installed by the ``loop`` extra.
